<title>USA: Prudential Insurance sees mortgage jump in 1997.</title>
<headline>Prudential Insurance sees mortgage jump in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Insurance Co. said on Friday it expects to originate up to $2.5 billion in commercial mortgage loans in 1997, which would be a 19 percent increase from last year's $2.1 billion.</p>
<p>Prudential said the target reflected its confidence in the continuing recovery of the real estate markets, and the company's expectation that risk-adjusted returns on mortgages will do well compared to other kinds of assets.</p>
</text>
